  "title": "Vegetarian Enchilada Casserole",
  "description": "This vegetarian enchilada casserole has layers of tortillas with enchilada sauce loaded with black beans, spicy peppers, tempeh, and lots of cheese.",
  "authors": [
    "Carol Hilderbrand"
  ],
  "date_published": "1999-06-24T11:30:50-04:00",
